==== wheelFriction ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Modifier friction of wheel for vehicle part.

<!--T:3-->
Higher wheel friction increases the grip tires have on the road.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
wheelFriction = 1.8,
</syntaxhighlight>
